  "content": {
    "title": "开展双百共建\"筑牢疫情防线，积极复工复产\"主题党日活动",
    "source": "中心党支部",
    "publishDate": "2022-05-13",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 为贯彻落实党中央疫情防控方针政策，进一步落实落细常态化</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">疫情</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">防控措施，中心党支部与浦东社区联合开展</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“'</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">双百共</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">建</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">'</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">筑牢疫情防线，积极复工复产</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">”</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">党日活动</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"510\" src=\"assets/9ed4f80a2ea5dcc54d02403e21104225b781bf5106a0ce1fc267e85a2d943c6d.jpg\" width=\"680\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 2022年5月13日</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">上午</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">9时</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">中心</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">党</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">支部与浦东社区</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">党支部及辖区</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">医</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">院医</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">护人员一</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">起</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">在经开区便民核酸检测点</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">为驻街商户</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">进行核酸检测</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">中心党支部承担核酸检测扫码和</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">维持</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">现场</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">秩序</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">工作。为</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">周边商</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">户</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">群众</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">提供便利的检测服务</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">同时为</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">保护人民群众生命健康安全</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">做出一份贡献。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"306\" src=\"assets/a54a3dae4975c140a0d1661aaa1eb3bb160df411ee57e0dfad47a482570f8f88.jpg\" width=\"680\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 在完成核酸检测任务之后，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">浦东社区医护人员为</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">我单位</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">窗口一线</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">服务</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">人员讲解</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">防护服穿脱等</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">疫情防护</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">的</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">基本常识和相关要求，共同推进</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">我单位</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">无疫机关建设。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"510\" src=\"assets/b9035306cbb7d4e03bb552bc514d7347339073a51f5a7ae871fadf5d3bab036c.jpg\" width=\"680\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 在与浦东社区一起共同为群众服务的半天时间里，我们对社区基层党组织的工作有了更深的了解！交谈中，体会到在过去的二个月的抗疫时间里，基层防疫工作人员为争取整个疫情防控工作取得胜利所做出的贡献和付出的辛苦！社区吴主任感谢我们对他们工作的理解和支持，表示今后要继续加强沟通联络，互通有无，彼此帮助，争取为群众提供更多更优质的便利服务</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n                ",
    "externalUrl": null
  },
